course: dictionary
lesson: 176
title: Agreement: same opinion, a deal, or matching words
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Agreement is a noun, so you can say an agreement, the agreement, or agreements. It can mean having the same opinion, as in «We were in agreement», or a plan or deal that people make together. Context clues tell you which meaning fits.
explain: «Children have special rights under a United Nations agreement.» The words United Nations and rights show that agreement means a formal promise made by many countries. Test your meaning by swapping in a deal or promise. If it still makes sense, you have the right meaning.
explain: «Agreements to own up instead of blaming each other can make a family calmer.» Here an agreement is a promise between people, and the clue calmer shows that agreeing helps settle arguments. In grammar, agreement means words matching, like «he runs» and «they run».
fact: Agreement means having the same opinion, or a plan or deal that two or more people make together.
fact: «Reach an agreement» means people settle something together, often by talking and compromising.
fact: «Nod in agreement» means nodding yes to show you think the same as someone else.
fact: The Good Friday Agreement of 1998 brought peace after years of conflict in Northern Ireland.
fact: In grammar, agreement means the subject and verb must match: «she sings», «they sing».
exercise: «We were in agreement about where to go on holiday.» What does in agreement mean here? | *Having the same opinion | Running away | Lost and confused | Arguing loudly
exercise: «Children have special rights under a United Nations agreement.» What is an agreement in this sentence? | *A formal promise or deal made by countries | A kind of weather | One person's wish | A type of song
exercise: «They ___ to school together every day.» Which verb shows correct agreement with they? | runs | running | *run | ran
test: «The two friends reached an agreement and shared the last biscuit.» What does reached an agreement mean? | They lost the biscuit | They argued forever | *They made a deal they both accepted | They stopped talking
test: «He nodded in agreement.» What does nodding in agreement show? | He wanted to leave | *He agreed with the idea | He was asleep | He was cross
exam: Which sentence correctly describes agreement in grammar? | Agreement means a lot of happy people | Agreement is a long river in Spain | Agreement is a kind of paint | *The subject and verb must match, like «she sings»
